entries.en:
Ms. Moriwaka, will you do an interview
for a job advertisement magazine? We were going to interview Ms. Kagami,
but she had to go on a business trip.

However,
for some people,
being liked is part of their job.

The lease went up
from 2.7 million to 2.9 million yen. There is a 5% rebate,
so it's actually 2.75 million.
